WEBVTT

01:41.780 --> 01:49.009
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.600 --> 01:51.800
[Episode 12]

01:55.350 --> 01:56.479
Okay, class is over.

01:56.820 --> 01:58.160
[Reading Corner]

01:57.200 --> 01:58.729
Remember to revise at home.

02:01.900 --> 02:03.590
Class, don't rush off just yet.

02:03.590 --> 02:04.400
Director.

02:04.580 --> 02:06.920
[Reading Corner]

02:04.870 --> 02:06.870
I have good news to share.

02:08.000 --> 02:08.840
Today, the school

02:08.840 --> 02:10.169
received an invitation

02:10.360 --> 02:12.750
to invite Lin Zhixia
from Class 1, Grade 10

02:13.030 --> 02:15.760
to attend the Marine Science Seminar
next month.

02:18.400 --> 02:19.910
The Marine Science Seminar

02:19.910 --> 02:21.410
offers tremendous value.

02:21.870 --> 02:24.910
Many experts and scholars in the field
will be there.

02:25.190 --> 02:26.430
Lin Zhixia's article

02:26.430 --> 02:27.760
has been chosen by them.

02:28.000 --> 02:28.710
The organizer has

02:28.710 --> 02:30.280
asked her to share and exchange insights

02:30.280 --> 02:31.960
as a student representative.

02:32.560 --> 02:33.430
This is the invitation.

02:33.430 --> 02:34.690
Lin Zhixia, come here.

02:35.470 --> 02:36.280
Class,

02:36.360 --> 02:38.020
let us encourage and cheer for

02:38.120 --> 02:40.360
Lin Zhixia with our applause.

02:41.060 --> 02:42.220
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

02:46.750 --> 02:47.950
Thank you, Director.

02:48.310 --> 02:49.030
All the best.

02:49.030 --> 02:50.030
Class dismissed.

02:50.579 --> 02:53.290
[Invitation]

02:53.370 --> 02:56.130
Lin Zhixia, you are so energetic.

02:56.500 --> 02:58.500
We had such a busy
school anniversary week,

02:58.500 --> 03:00.560
but you still had time
to do research.

03:00.810 --> 03:02.860
It's an old article
I previously published.

03:02.860 --> 03:04.590
I didn't expect it to be chosen.

03:04.650 --> 03:06.380
Lin Zhixia, congratulations.

03:06.970 --> 03:08.860
My mom always asked me
to go to this event.

03:08.860 --> 03:10.320
I'll go with you this year.

03:10.560 --> 03:11.560
You're going too?

03:11.640 --> 03:13.460
[Awards Board]

03:13.030 --> 03:13.400
Yeah.

03:13.870 --> 03:14.920
That's great.

03:15.030 --> 03:16.880
I was just feeling a little nervous.

03:16.880 --> 03:19.210
I've never presented at a seminar before.

03:19.340 --> 03:20.200
How about this?

03:20.290 --> 03:21.810
My mom's at the lab this weekend.

03:21.810 --> 03:23.270
You can ask her for advice.

03:23.690 --> 03:24.410
Okay.

03:25.020 --> 03:26.440
[Awards Board]

03:45.630 --> 03:46.340
Duan!

03:47.460 --> 03:48.660
Have a soda, my treat.

03:50.470 --> 03:50.900
Why?

03:52.690 --> 03:53.630
It's on me.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.740
Here, take it.

03:56.380 --> 03:57.380
Is it poisoned?

04:01.140 --> 04:03.350
Your side profile is amazing.

04:03.690 --> 04:05.020
Look at that jawline.

04:06.280 --> 04:07.210
Ma'am.

04:07.650 --> 04:09.410
Are you sick?

04:10.210 --> 04:11.740
Just tell me what you want.

04:14.620 --> 04:18.190
It's not a big deal.

04:18.740 --> 04:20.500
Well,

04:22.420 --> 04:25.420
I think the way you tossed the ball
the other day was...

04:25.910 --> 04:26.710
It was very...

04:27.100 --> 04:28.030
Get to the point.

04:29.180 --> 04:31.380
Can you get me a signed photo
of Han Geng?

04:31.930 --> 04:32.420
Why?

04:34.450 --> 04:36.659
Zhao Shuran from the next class

04:36.870 --> 04:38.400
insists that I got scammed.

04:38.690 --> 04:41.370
She said those who went to the concert
all got the signature.

04:41.370 --> 04:42.540
She was right.

04:42.870 --> 04:43.980
You were scammed.

04:43.980 --> 04:44.570
I...

04:47.330 --> 04:49.300
I don't want to lose face.

04:51.270 --> 04:52.620
Please help me.

04:53.010 --> 04:55.000
I have no choice.

04:55.250 --> 04:56.980
I'm willing to spend more money.

04:56.980 --> 04:58.010
I need it fast.

04:59.180 --> 04:59.740
Ma'am,

05:00.370 --> 05:02.130
with what money?

05:02.930 --> 05:05.250
Didn't you treat us to the amusement park

05:05.420 --> 05:07.280
with the money we got back for you?

05:08.130 --> 05:08.980
Yes...

05:09.420 --> 05:10.860
If I had enough money,

05:10.860 --> 05:12.520
would I be asking you for help?

05:13.010 --> 05:14.250
The Trendy Shop behind our school

05:14.250 --> 05:15.570
is selling Han Geng's signed photo

05:15.570 --> 05:16.570
for 800 per photo.

05:16.570 --> 05:17.810
Can I afford that?

05:21.420 --> 05:25.020
Duan, I know you have many connections
and tricks up your sleeve.

05:25.120 --> 05:27.210
I'm sure you can get me
a signed photo.

05:27.770 --> 05:28.500
Right?

05:31.660 --> 05:32.450
Please.

05:32.610 --> 05:33.690
Please...

05:34.130 --> 05:35.060
Please!

05:35.659 --> 05:36.659
Please...

05:36.980 --> 05:37.490
Stop,

05:37.510 --> 05:38.300
stop!

05:38.420 --> 05:39.220
Stop it.

05:41.740 --> 05:42.450
No.

05:42.690 --> 05:44.620
I think you're out of your mind.

05:44.860 --> 05:45.659
Duan Qiyan!

05:46.300 --> 05:47.830
Didn't I ask nicely enough?

05:48.370 --> 05:50.010
I used to think you were a loyal guy.

05:50.010 --> 05:51.500
Well, I was wrong.

05:51.690 --> 05:53.650
When you were young, you came to my house
and got beaten up by your dad.

05:53.650 --> 05:55.750
You even ate my food.
Did I ever complain about that?

05:55.750 --> 05:56.330
Also,

05:56.350 --> 05:58.010
once you left a bottle of tadpoles
at my place

05:58.010 --> 05:59.620
and they all turned into toads.

05:59.620 --> 06:01.420
It took me forever to catch them.

06:16.050 --> 06:18.050
If I lose out
in front of Zhao Shuran,

06:18.070 --> 06:19.730
I'll never go to school again.

06:19.770 --> 06:20.570
See you never.

06:23.130 --> 06:23.860
Wait.

06:29.860 --> 06:32.130
Now that's the Tang Tingting I know.

06:33.060 --> 06:34.190
That act just now...

06:34.420 --> 06:35.420
"Please..."

06:35.690 --> 06:37.090
Why were you acting cute?

06:40.370 --> 06:42.300
It's just an autograph.

06:43.250 --> 06:44.300
I'll help you.

06:45.740 --> 06:46.860
Duan!

06:47.500 --> 06:48.770
Hands off.

06:50.330 --> 06:51.130
Your treat.

06:54.860 --> 06:55.690
Class,

06:56.180 --> 06:57.440
today, we're studying

06:57.620 --> 06:59.610
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

06:57.890 --> 06:59.500
"My Castle in the Air."

07:00.190 --> 07:01.240
This prose

07:01.370 --> 07:03.250
adopts a writing style that combines

07:03.250 --> 07:04.980
both reality and imagination.

07:05.010 --> 07:08.370
The mountain cabin
is a real dwelling place.

07:08.400 --> 07:09.850
That's realism.

07:10.370 --> 07:12.350
It's also a spiritual resting place.

07:12.350 --> 07:14.010
That's imaginative writing.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.350
I'm so nervous.

07:16.930 --> 07:17.980
It's okay.

07:18.690 --> 07:19.690
I'm here with you.

07:36.430 --> 07:39.760
It symbolizes the balance
between materiality and ideals.

07:39.890 --> 07:40.620
Understand?

07:40.780 --> 07:43.440
What are you doing
instead of paying attention?

07:44.430 --> 07:45.470
Yes, you.

07:45.810 --> 07:46.540
Duan Qiyan.

07:49.220 --> 07:50.300
I've just explained

07:50.300 --> 07:51.930
the prose, "My Castle in the Air."

07:51.930 --> 07:53.130
Now, summarize for me

07:53.130 --> 07:55.040
the characteristics of the prose.

07:55.040 --> 07:56.040
What characteristics?

07:56.040 --> 07:56.800
This one.

07:56.830 --> 07:57.360
This one.

08:04.210 --> 08:05.940
[Han Geng]

08:11.620 --> 08:12.420
Duan Qiyan.

08:12.810 --> 08:14.070
What did I say just now?

08:23.780 --> 08:24.690
Duan Qiyan.

08:25.180 --> 08:27.370
I was wondering why you couldn't improve
your language test scores.

08:27.370 --> 08:29.430
So you're focused on this instead?

08:31.350 --> 08:32.679
What did you write here?

08:32.789 --> 08:33.320
Han Geng?

08:34.650 --> 08:35.380
Autograph?

08:36.460 --> 08:37.409
Seriously.

08:37.409 --> 08:38.120
Duan Qiyan,

08:38.500 --> 08:39.460
aren't you going to take
the college entrance exam?

08:39.460 --> 08:40.700
Are you planning to be a star?

08:40.700 --> 08:41.460
Are you?

08:41.940 --> 08:42.860
Is that it?

08:44.740 --> 08:45.530
Be quiet.

08:51.770 --> 08:52.770
Stop laughing.

08:53.820 --> 08:54.750
Let's continue.

09:09.580 --> 09:10.650
Tang Tingting.

09:11.050 --> 09:12.010
Long time no see.

09:12.170 --> 09:13.100
Have you been avoiding me?

09:13.100 --> 09:13.890
No.

09:14.740 --> 09:17.470
Haven't you brought Han Geng's
signed photo yet?

09:18.220 --> 09:19.770
I did.

09:19.860 --> 09:21.290
It's in the folder I keep

09:21.290 --> 09:23.150
in the bag drawer in my classroom.

09:23.890 --> 09:26.820
Liars tend to embellish details.

09:28.460 --> 09:29.660
You don't believe me?

09:29.940 --> 09:31.340
Follow me to the classroom, then.

09:31.340 --> 09:32.530
Okay, let's go.

09:32.580 --> 09:33.250
Let's go.

09:36.770 --> 09:37.500
Lesson time.

09:38.370 --> 09:39.970
I'll show it to you next time.

09:53.340 --> 09:54.050
Boss.

09:55.940 --> 09:57.980
I came to the store a while ago

09:57.980 --> 09:59.100
and asked about
Han Geng's signed photo.

09:59.100 --> 10:00.050
Do you remember?

10:01.460 --> 10:02.890
I remember. What's up?

10:04.890 --> 10:06.940
It's kind of embarrassing.

10:07.460 --> 10:09.820
I really want to buy that signed photo.

10:09.890 --> 10:11.410
Can you sell it to me first?

10:11.410 --> 10:13.700
I'll work part-time for you every day

10:13.700 --> 10:14.700
after school in return.

10:14.700 --> 10:16.050
The salary amount is up to you.

10:16.050 --> 10:16.770
Don't worry.

10:16.770 --> 10:17.890
I'm very eloquent.

10:17.940 --> 10:19.370
Hiring me is definitely worth it.

10:19.370 --> 10:20.370
I can see that.

10:20.500 --> 10:22.130
But you're too late.

10:22.700 --> 10:25.340
Han Geng's signed photo has been sold.

10:26.010 --> 10:27.100
Sold?

10:30.870 --> 10:31.530
Okay.

10:32.290 --> 10:33.170
Thank you.

10:33.500 --> 10:34.430
You're welcome.

10:49.240 --> 10:52.250
[New shoes in stock]

11:39.890 --> 11:40.650
How about this?

11:40.650 --> 11:42.450
My mom's at the lab this weekend.

11:42.580 --> 11:44.040
You can ask her for advice.

12:06.170 --> 12:06.980
Lin Zhixia.

12:10.970 --> 12:12.160
Why are you here?

12:13.150 --> 12:15.740
I remember you'd be at
Professor Shen's lab today.

12:15.740 --> 12:17.740
I happened to be in the neighborhood.

12:17.740 --> 12:18.580
It's raining.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.010
I thought you might not have an umbrella,

12:20.010 --> 12:21.340
so I stopped by to check.

12:22.050 --> 12:23.650
Thank you, my savior.

12:24.640 --> 12:25.170
Let's go.

12:43.370 --> 12:44.030
Lin Zhixia,

12:45.010 --> 12:46.620
what would you have done

12:47.290 --> 12:48.690
if I didn't come by today?

12:48.770 --> 12:49.940
Continue with my experiment

12:49.940 --> 12:51.740
and go home after the rain stops.

12:53.020 --> 12:54.620
What if the rain never stops?

12:57.220 --> 12:59.640
That's meteorologically impossible.

13:00.170 --> 13:02.800
The total amount of rain
on Earth is constant.

13:03.170 --> 13:05.030
After the rainwater evaporates,

13:05.290 --> 13:06.740
new clouds will form.

13:06.740 --> 13:08.340
It won't pile up infinitely.

13:08.950 --> 13:10.650
If it keeps raining,

13:10.740 --> 13:14.170
The atmospheric pressure will compress
these raindrops into fog.

13:14.170 --> 13:17.220
In the end, it will form a vast,
foggy state of chaos.

13:17.620 --> 13:19.020
Then we'd all drown in it.

13:19.700 --> 13:21.030
That's not what I meant.

13:21.860 --> 13:23.590
Then what are you referring to?

13:24.460 --> 13:25.340
I mean,

13:26.460 --> 13:27.650
if it keeps raining,

13:28.130 --> 13:30.130
and you have to ask someone for help.

13:30.860 --> 13:31.860
Who would you ask?

13:34.760 --> 13:35.380
Security.

13:35.410 --> 13:37.290
There should be an umbrella
in the security room.

13:37.290 --> 13:39.150
What if the security is not there?

13:39.390 --> 13:42.010
I'll ask my seniors in the lab for help.

13:42.700 --> 13:44.840
I'll walk them back to their dorms first,

13:44.840 --> 13:46.840
and ask them to lend me the umbrella.

13:47.770 --> 13:49.500
What if they are all not around?

13:54.890 --> 13:57.150
I can't possibly let you come all this way

13:57.270 --> 13:58.800
just to pass me an umbrella.

14:02.500 --> 14:03.290
Right.

14:07.580 --> 14:09.640
Luckily, I happened to pass by today.

14:19.800 --> 14:27.420
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

14:28.580 --> 14:32.900
♪ One second of encounter,
heartstrings stirred ♪

14:31.720 --> 14:32.980
Then I really am lucky.

14:33.430 --> 14:36.790
♪ The story feels altogether different ♪

14:39.000 --> 14:46.740
♪ How to describe
my whimsical wandering dream? ♪

14:47.990 --> 14:52.210
♪ You softly answer my quirky side ♪

14:52.600 --> 14:55.940
♪ Such bliss to finally be understood ♪

15:05.910 --> 15:07.510
And I called
Duan Qiyan's handwriting ugly...

15:07.510 --> 15:09.150
Mine is even worse.

15:10.620 --> 15:11.240
Tang!

15:18.030 --> 15:19.910
Tang, hurry up.

15:20.910 --> 15:22.570
Come down. What are you doing?

15:28.000 --> 15:30.120
Why are you looking for me at this hour?

15:30.120 --> 15:31.670
Do I need a reason to see you?

15:32.320 --> 15:34.650
Obviously, you have one. Get to the point.

15:37.630 --> 15:38.630
Actually,

15:39.750 --> 15:41.390
it's not a big deal.

15:42.390 --> 15:43.480
I just happen to have

15:43.480 --> 15:45.270
prepared a small gift for you.

15:46.150 --> 15:47.870
But I think it's more sincere to give

15:47.870 --> 15:48.840
gifts in person.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.360
So I came to you.

15:54.200 --> 15:55.080
Open it.

15:55.360 --> 15:57.360
What is it? So mysterious.

15:57.940 --> 15:59.290
Just open it up.

16:01.000 --> 16:01.870
Hurry up.

16:05.380 --> 16:07.810
[Han Geng]

16:06.630 --> 16:07.630
The signed photo!

16:08.150 --> 16:09.280
Where did you get it?

16:10.550 --> 16:12.630
Who do you think I am?

16:14.080 --> 16:15.510
This is

16:15.510 --> 16:17.600
a piece of cake to me.

16:18.600 --> 16:20.550
Getting this signed photo

16:20.580 --> 16:23.600
is as easy for me
as getting full marks on an exam.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.150
Didn't you tell me

16:26.150 --> 16:28.010
you wanted Han Geng’s autograph?

16:28.650 --> 16:29.600
So I asked

16:29.600 --> 16:32.170
one of my many bros.

16:32.670 --> 16:34.270
He is part of the industry.

16:34.410 --> 16:36.030
He has some connections.

16:36.320 --> 16:37.270
I told him

16:37.270 --> 16:39.440
I wanted an autograph of Han Geng,

16:37.370 --> 16:43.370
[Han Geng]

16:39.790 --> 16:41.000
and he agreed.

16:41.000 --> 16:41.790
So,

16:41.790 --> 16:43.200
he asked Han Geng for it.

16:43.480 --> 16:45.240
But there was a problem.

16:45.270 --> 16:46.470
What was the problem?

16:47.750 --> 16:49.630
Didn't you notice my shoes?

16:49.750 --> 16:52.770
These are the new shoes
I bought for this performance.

16:53.000 --> 16:56.000
The shop owner of the Trendy Shop
behind our school

16:55.150 --> 16:59.820
[New shoes in stock]

16:56.000 --> 16:57.750
raised his offer to 1,000 yuan

16:57.750 --> 16:58.670
to buy my shoes.

16:58.670 --> 17:00.000
But I declined it.

17:04.030 --> 17:05.400
But you know

17:05.720 --> 17:06.680
who Han Geng is.

17:06.680 --> 17:09.790
He's the hottest and best star now.

17:10.030 --> 17:11.750
Throughout the whole process,

17:11.750 --> 17:13.000
my execution

17:13.000 --> 17:14.240
and calculation

17:15.920 --> 17:17.780
were nothing short of brilliant.

17:19.960 --> 17:21.880
Duan Qiyan, you big idiot!

17:32.900 --> 17:34.920
Shouldn't she be happy?

17:37.850 --> 17:39.310
Did I say something wrong?

17:44.240 --> 17:45.860
[A hundred-year undertaking
begins with education]

17:50.670 --> 17:54.420
[A New Chapter, A New Journey]

18:05.010 --> 18:05.870
Tang Tingting.

18:06.610 --> 18:07.850
So you knew that

18:07.850 --> 18:10.380
I sold my sneakers
to buy you the signed photo?

18:12.590 --> 18:14.390
Now that my sneakers are back...

18:14.850 --> 18:16.580
You returned the signed photo?

18:18.900 --> 18:21.210
How will you brag to Zhao Shuran now?

18:21.560 --> 18:22.400
Well...

18:22.900 --> 18:24.380
When did I brag?

18:25.050 --> 18:27.250
I'm an honest person, okay?

18:28.010 --> 18:30.290
Besides, no need for an overkill.

18:30.440 --> 18:31.610
I don't need a signed photo

18:31.610 --> 18:32.940
to outdo Zhao Shuran.

18:33.290 --> 18:34.180
You, on the other hand,

18:34.180 --> 18:36.050
act like you're soulless
without these shoes.

18:36.050 --> 18:37.780
Can you stop being so childish?

18:39.290 --> 18:40.980
Correction.

18:42.050 --> 18:43.310
These are not shoes.

18:45.250 --> 18:46.570
This is classic.

18:48.940 --> 18:50.140
Classic. Whatever.

18:50.480 --> 18:51.740
I've returned your stinky shoes.

18:51.740 --> 18:52.770
We're even now.

18:53.900 --> 18:54.570
Stinky.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.240
Does it smell?

19:01.440 --> 19:02.660
It doesn't.

19:06.660 --> 19:07.520
It smells good.

19:26.480 --> 19:27.440
Ms. Tang.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.260
Congratulations.

19:31.640 --> 19:32.880
I told you.

19:32.880 --> 19:34.880
Our class is full of hidden talents.

19:35.510 --> 19:36.750
Congrats to you, too.

19:36.960 --> 19:39.220
A participation award is still an award.

19:39.640 --> 19:40.920
Unfortunately, your class's award

19:40.920 --> 19:42.400
has nothing to do with you.

19:42.790 --> 19:44.720
All you did was clap on the side.

19:44.960 --> 19:47.400
Do you know what a team is?

19:49.030 --> 19:49.890
Tang Tingting.

19:50.310 --> 19:52.720
You haven’t shown me
Han Geng’s signed photo yet.

19:52.720 --> 19:53.880
Are you going to say

19:53.880 --> 19:55.310
you left it in class again?

19:55.310 --> 19:56.400
Are you going back to class?

19:56.400 --> 19:57.640
I’ll go with you.

19:58.590 --> 20:00.250
Zhao Shuran, you are so weird.

20:00.790 --> 20:03.030
You knew I was scammed, right?

20:03.880 --> 20:05.960
Isn't it miserable to just
hold it in and wait

20:05.960 --> 20:07.030
for me to slip up?

20:07.110 --> 20:07.790
You...

20:08.310 --> 20:10.400
Yes, I didn't go to the concert.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.590
So what?

20:11.880 --> 20:14.080
My classmates were so worried about me.

20:14.200 --> 20:15.640
They sneaked into the QQ group

20:15.640 --> 20:16.880
to find the trading location.

20:16.880 --> 20:18.030
After they found me,

20:18.030 --> 20:19.070
we caught that scalper

20:19.070 --> 20:20.920
on Tieba together.

20:21.270 --> 20:22.200
Let me tell you,

20:22.240 --> 20:24.550
so many fans wanted to gift me a banner.

20:24.680 --> 20:25.830
I said, "No, no.

20:25.830 --> 20:27.510
We're doing this for the people.
It's a given."

20:27.510 --> 20:28.510
Tang Tingting,

20:28.720 --> 20:31.120
quit spouting the nonsense you dreamed up.

20:31.680 --> 20:34.270
I bet this would be a good dream for you.

20:35.640 --> 20:36.920
After helping the people,

20:36.920 --> 20:38.310
Lin Zhixia found the best place

20:38.310 --> 20:40.110
outside the venue for us

20:40.110 --> 20:41.410
to listen to the concert together.

20:41.410 --> 20:42.640
It was much more interesting

20:42.640 --> 20:44.440
than watching it in the stadium.

20:45.070 --> 20:47.290
We lay on the grass together.

20:47.550 --> 20:49.240
Above us, a sky full of stars.

20:49.890 --> 20:52.240
And by our ears, Han Geng's singing.

20:52.270 --> 20:53.930
Have you ever experienced it?

20:54.680 --> 20:57.540
I've never seen anyone
who's so proud to be scammed.

20:59.130 --> 20:59.590
Yes.

21:00.590 --> 21:03.550
I was afraid you would find out
that I was scammed.

21:04.110 --> 21:05.840
That would make me look stupid.

21:06.550 --> 21:08.500
But I've figured it out these days.

21:08.750 --> 21:11.080
I think it's more stupid
to feel this fear.

21:12.110 --> 21:13.400
So what if I tell you now?

21:13.400 --> 21:14.640
I feel much better.

21:15.550 --> 21:16.440
Zhao Shuran,

21:16.680 --> 21:18.160
you should find a new topic

21:18.160 --> 21:19.240
to talk to me now.

21:20.030 --> 21:20.830
Wait.

21:21.960 --> 21:23.830
No one talks to you

21:23.960 --> 21:25.400
except for me, right?

21:25.680 --> 21:26.270
You...

21:26.640 --> 21:27.770
You have no friends.

21:28.350 --> 21:30.480
Consider changing your personality.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.130
[A hundred-year undertaking
begins with education]

22:08.510 --> 22:11.400
The impact o-of marine pollution

22:11.880 --> 22:15.070
h-has already attracted
widespread attention.

22:15.880 --> 22:16.960
But today,

22:17.270 --> 22:19.870
I-I want to specifically discuss
the impact of

22:22.070 --> 22:23.110
m-microplastic.

22:24.510 --> 22:26.350
Currently, microplastic

22:26.380 --> 22:27.200
h-has...

22:27.400 --> 22:28.460
What are you doing?

22:28.720 --> 22:31.000
Zeqiu, I'm stuttering.

22:31.960 --> 22:32.720
Stuttering?

22:33.750 --> 22:35.680
I have to present at the seminar tomorrow,

22:35.680 --> 22:37.070
but now I stutter the moment I speak.

22:37.070 --> 22:38.790
I can't tell you're stuttering at all.

22:38.790 --> 22:39.790
Come and listen.

22:40.510 --> 22:42.170
Let me see what the problem is.

22:44.550 --> 22:45.550
Hello, everyone.

22:46.070 --> 22:48.920
I'm today's high school student
representative, Lin Zhixia.

22:48.920 --> 22:50.400
Today, I...

22:51.550 --> 22:54.350
Today I want to talk about the impact of

22:54.680 --> 22:55.270
mi...

22:56.440 --> 22:58.240
m-microplastic...

22:59.110 --> 22:59.920
r-rubbish...

23:01.570 --> 23:03.970
on marine pollution.

23:04.000 --> 23:04.390
Wait.

23:04.410 --> 23:05.160
Wait.

23:06.500 --> 23:09.240
You don't usually talk like this.

23:09.750 --> 23:10.920
I don't know either.

23:11.400 --> 23:13.860
I get nervous whenever
I think of the speech.

23:15.930 --> 23:16.760
Try again.

23:16.790 --> 23:17.640
One more time.

23:18.960 --> 23:19.760
One more time.

23:21.420 --> 23:22.440
Actually,

23:26.070 --> 23:28.680
the pollution o-of plastic waste

23:30.070 --> 23:32.510
h-has already drawn widespread concern.

23:32.510 --> 23:33.310
That's enough.

23:33.310 --> 23:34.950
Alright, alright.

23:35.510 --> 23:37.110
What kind of problem is this?

23:37.510 --> 23:39.400
I finally understand why Jiang Yubai

23:39.400 --> 23:41.640
stuttered when he first saw me.

23:43.030 --> 23:44.350
What should I do?

23:49.750 --> 23:51.010
I can't help with this.

23:51.960 --> 23:53.160
Nope. Can't help you.

23:53.830 --> 23:55.550
You can't leave.

23:56.270 --> 23:57.680
You're stuttering. It's a condition.

23:57.680 --> 23:58.540
I can't cure it.

23:59.230 --> 24:00.720
Please help me.

24:00.790 --> 24:01.720
I can't help you.

24:01.720 --> 24:03.160
Zeqiu, please help me.

24:03.160 --> 24:04.680
My presentation is tomorrow.

24:04.680 --> 24:07.110
I'm going to discuss with the experts
on behalf of high school students.

24:07.110 --> 24:08.720
Professor Shen gave me this chance.

24:08.720 --> 24:11.030
I can't screw it up no matter what!

24:11.030 --> 24:11.750
Zeqiu!

24:11.750 --> 24:13.440
I need someone to practice on.

24:13.440 --> 24:14.480
If you listen to my presentation,

24:14.480 --> 24:15.680
you can give me feedback.

24:15.680 --> 24:16.350
If I do well,

24:16.350 --> 24:18.160
wouldn't you be happy, Zeqiu?

24:18.680 --> 24:19.480
Yes.

24:19.720 --> 24:21.980
Aren't you talking quite well right now?

24:23.240 --> 24:23.960
Right?

24:24.350 --> 24:25.400
Relax.

24:25.400 --> 24:27.480
Just persuade others the way
you persuade me.

24:27.480 --> 24:28.720
Take your time.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.480
A seminar is basically
just people chatting.

24:30.480 --> 24:31.880
Like how we're chatting.

24:32.350 --> 24:33.030
Okay?

24:33.240 --> 24:34.040
One more time.

24:40.680 --> 24:41.510
Zeqiu, please help me.

24:41.510 --> 24:42.270
My presentation is tomorrow.

24:42.270 --> 24:43.110
I'm going to discuss with the experts
on behalf of...

24:43.110 --> 24:44.720
Wait, wait, wait.

24:44.720 --> 24:46.640
Read your script.

24:56.030 --> 24:58.180
Zhixia, did you bring everything?

25:01.680 --> 25:02.480
Zhixia,

25:03.550 --> 25:05.080
bring these 2 eggs with you.

25:05.590 --> 25:07.990
Eat them if you're hungry while traveling.

25:08.750 --> 25:10.610
You'll be living alone out there.

25:10.640 --> 25:12.160
You really don't need us to accompany you?

25:12.160 --> 25:14.240
It's fine, I'm just going to the suburbs.

25:14.240 --> 25:16.590
Okay. Take this money.

25:16.960 --> 25:18.270
Keep it close and don't lose it.

25:18.270 --> 25:20.720
Food and accommodation are covered.
I don't need to spend money.

25:20.720 --> 25:22.240
Doesn't hurt to be prepared.

25:22.240 --> 25:22.960
Take it.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.720
Keep it properly. Don't lose it.

25:24.720 --> 25:25.830
Why are you up?

25:25.830 --> 25:26.830
Let me send her there, Mom.

25:26.830 --> 25:27.720
You will?

25:27.720 --> 25:28.200
I will.

25:28.200 --> 25:28.830
Alright.

25:29.550 --> 25:30.270
I'm leaving, Mom.

25:30.270 --> 25:31.590
Be careful.

25:32.400 --> 25:34.720
Don't sleep in the car. Be alert.

25:35.030 --> 25:36.310
When you're out and about,

25:36.310 --> 25:38.440
nothing is more important than safety.

25:38.440 --> 25:40.310
You must lock the door.

25:40.310 --> 25:41.030
Got that?

25:42.990 --> 25:49.170
[Healthy Living]

25:43.270 --> 25:46.270
Don't just lock the door.

25:46.750 --> 25:49.720
Lock up whatever chain lock or bolt lock

25:50.880 --> 25:52.410
you can find on the door too.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.350
Got that?

26:05.110 --> 26:05.880
Wang Tao.

26:10.920 --> 26:12.350
Last summer vacation,

26:12.750 --> 26:14.480
they went on a family vacation.

26:15.030 --> 26:16.030
When they checked in,

26:16.030 --> 26:18.890
they learned that a fire once broke out
in the hotel,

26:19.270 --> 26:20.730
killing dozens of people.

26:21.400 --> 26:22.500
But they didn't take it seriously

26:22.500 --> 26:23.440
and moved in.

26:24.510 --> 26:25.710
That night,

26:25.770 --> 26:28.370
his mother and his sister
were in the same room.

26:28.790 --> 26:30.070
At 3 a.m.,

26:30.070 --> 26:32.150
his mother was fast asleep.

26:32.790 --> 26:37.640
His sister was awakened
by the sound of knocking.

26:38.510 --> 26:39.160
Knock...

26:40.070 --> 26:40.720
Knock...

26:41.750 --> 26:42.400
Knock...

26:43.160 --> 26:43.790
Knock...

26:45.790 --> 26:47.850
It sounded like someone was carefully

26:47.850 --> 26:50.440
knocking on the door with their knuckles.

26:54.610 --> 26:56.390
Isn't Wang Tao your
primary school classmate?

26:56.390 --> 26:57.450
Yes, that Wang Tao.

26:58.030 --> 26:59.150
I thought he had a brother.

26:59.150 --> 27:00.610
How did it become a sister?

27:01.720 --> 27:02.920
It was a sister all along.
You remembered wrongly.

27:02.920 --> 27:03.960
Let me continue.

27:05.440 --> 27:10.110
His sister got up to check
who was outside the door.

27:07.730 --> 27:13.700
[Healthy Living]

27:10.810 --> 27:13.410
At that moment,
the sound of knocking stopped.

27:14.440 --> 27:16.500
His sister thought she had misheard,

27:16.510 --> 27:18.030
and went back to bed.

27:18.030 --> 27:20.110
But the moment she lay down,

27:20.270 --> 27:22.750
the knocking started again.

27:23.640 --> 27:24.500
Knock, knock, knock!

27:24.500 --> 27:25.700
Knock, knock, knock!

27:26.240 --> 27:28.970
His sister looked outside
through the peephole.

27:30.350 --> 27:33.110
There was no one outside,

27:34.750 --> 27:36.750
but the light in the corridor was on.

27:37.900 --> 27:38.480
At this moment,

27:38.480 --> 27:40.210
she made a very wrong decision.

27:40.750 --> 27:42.350
She opened the door.

27:46.160 --> 27:46.960
Suddenly!

27:49.010 --> 27:51.030
A gust of cold wind poured in,

27:51.030 --> 27:53.200
accompanied by a burnt smell.

27:53.310 --> 27:54.960
His sister rushed to bed
and continued sleeping.

27:54.960 --> 27:55.830
When she woke up the next morning,

27:55.830 --> 27:57.310
guess what they found.

27:57.400 --> 27:58.440
What did they find?

27:58.440 --> 28:00.640
They found black handprints

28:00.640 --> 28:02.880
all over her bed.

28:03.680 --> 28:05.030
It was as if those who died in the fire

28:05.030 --> 28:07.160
wiped their hands all over the sheets.

28:07.590 --> 28:10.480
Because she opened the door,

28:10.920 --> 28:12.590
they were allowed inside.

28:15.920 --> 28:17.070
This story

28:17.510 --> 28:19.030
tells us that when one is out and about,

28:19.030 --> 28:19.830
we must lock the door

28:19.830 --> 28:21.430
and never open it for anyone.

28:23.350 --> 28:24.830
This story tells us that

28:25.200 --> 28:27.730
you need to be logical
when making up stories.

28:27.850 --> 28:29.980
You're really bad at telling stories.

28:30.720 --> 28:32.510
No, this really happened.

28:32.720 --> 28:33.440
Really?

28:33.720 --> 28:34.350
Really.

28:34.830 --> 28:35.880
It really happened?

28:35.880 --> 28:36.920
Just ask Wang Tao.

28:40.940 --> 28:41.900
Wang Tao?

28:42.220 --> 28:42.750
Wang Tao.

31:02.250 --> 31:05.420
The sound of knocking was slow and light.

31:06.090 --> 31:08.090
Knock... Knock...

31:10.530 --> 31:12.500
It sounded like someone was carefully

31:12.500 --> 31:15.220
knocking on the door with their knuckles.

31:39.180 --> 31:39.940
Who is it?

31:49.240 --> 31:50.750
When she asked who was outside the door,

31:50.750 --> 31:53.030
the sound of knocking suddenly stopped.

31:53.380 --> 31:56.140
His sister looked outside
through the peephole,

31:57.140 --> 31:59.850
but there was no one outside.

31:59.980 --> 32:00.530
At this moment,

32:00.530 --> 32:02.460
she made a very wrong decision.

32:02.770 --> 32:04.380
She opened the door.

32:06.400 --> 32:07.200
Suddenly!

33:17.610 --> 33:24.790
[Unknown Number]

33:25.920 --> 33:26.980
Hello, Lin Zhixia.

33:32.880 --> 33:34.480
How did you know it was me?

33:36.700 --> 33:37.300
I guessed.

33:45.610 --> 33:46.290
Hello.

33:47.290 --> 33:47.900
Please

33:47.900 --> 33:49.770
tell the guest in Room 3021

33:50.610 --> 33:53.420
that her friend
left something for her at her door.

34:03.970 --> 34:07.010
[Do Not Disturb]

34:31.940 --> 34:34.460
The seminar happens tomorrow morning.

34:35.940 --> 34:38.170
I thought I'd be kept up by excitement,

34:38.650 --> 34:40.260
not nervousness.

34:41.610 --> 34:44.090
And I keep hearing noises
outside the door.

34:45.500 --> 34:46.170
Lin Zhixia,

34:46.820 --> 34:48.050
you're not nervous.

34:48.610 --> 34:49.870
You're scared, right?

34:55.730 --> 34:56.929
Looks like I'm right.

34:58.380 --> 34:59.170
I admit

35:00.340 --> 35:01.800
I'm a little scared.

35:03.900 --> 35:05.300
It's empty here

35:05.900 --> 35:07.340
and too quiet.

35:16.420 --> 35:17.010
Then...

35:18.800 --> 35:20.530
Are you afraid of the universe?

35:21.280 --> 35:22.110
No.

35:25.090 --> 35:26.890
But the universe is also silent.

35:30.940 --> 35:31.940
I understand now.

35:33.300 --> 35:35.210
My fear comes from the unknown.

35:36.900 --> 35:38.700
I know what the universe is like,

35:38.980 --> 35:40.240
so I'm not afraid of it.

35:40.800 --> 35:43.840
So, silence itself is not scary,

35:44.710 --> 35:45.400
right?

35:47.360 --> 35:48.280
You're right.

35:51.920 --> 35:52.630
Hello?

35:53.130 --> 35:53.840
Hello.

35:54.090 --> 35:56.230
Room 3021's line is currently occupied.

35:56.230 --> 35:57.630
We'll inform them later.

35:59.320 --> 36:01.150
Okay, thank you.

36:07.360 --> 36:08.150
Occupied?

36:09.400 --> 36:12.030
Lin Zhixia, go to bed early.

36:12.280 --> 36:14.210
You have a presentation tomorrow.

36:14.360 --> 36:16.550
Don't be scared, I won't hang up.

36:32.000 --> 36:33.400
Good night, Jiang Yubai.

36:34.960 --> 36:35.670
Good night.

36:36.800 --> 36:37.590
Lin Zhixia.

37:32.880 --> 37:33.590
Hello?

37:34.480 --> 37:35.150
Hello.

37:35.510 --> 37:37.710
Room 3021's line is still occupied.

37:38.280 --> 37:40.210
Do you still need me to call for you?

37:41.320 --> 37:42.920
Is the line always occupied?

37:43.400 --> 37:43.730
Yes.

37:44.940 --> 37:45.800
How about this?

37:46.090 --> 37:48.250
We'll try to contact them
every once in a while.

37:48.250 --> 37:50.780
We'll let you know
when it gets through, okay?

37:52.400 --> 37:53.860
Okay, thank you.

37:54.340 --> 37:55.270
You're welcome.

38:44.920 --> 38:45.840
Jiang Yubai.

38:54.880 --> 38:55.880
Why are you awake?

38:56.360 --> 38:57.890
Just sleep a little longer.

39:06.940 --> 39:07.480
Okay.

40:49.780 --> 40:50.840
Lin Zhixia!

40:53.170 --> 40:55.630
Lin Zhixia, I'm here!

41:03.190 --> 41:04.460
Jiang Yubai!

41:08.190 --> 41:09.630
Jiang Yubai!

41:52.710 --> 41:54.670
Jiang Yubai, are you still there?

41:58.800 --> 41:59.510
Yes.

42:04.510 --> 42:05.920
Did you stay up all night?

42:08.230 --> 42:10.510
Are you still scared?

42:13.550 --> 42:14.360
A little.

42:19.400 --> 42:20.400
But with you here,

42:20.960 --> 42:22.290
I'm not afraid anymore.

43:01.030 --> 43:01.830
Why are you...

43:05.070 --> 43:06.480
Can I hang up now?

43:12.010 --> 43:14.670
[In Call]

43:18.980 --> 43:20.340
When we were young,

43:21.530 --> 43:23.400
we had to do something crazy

43:23.980 --> 43:25.340
to live up to our youth.

43:27.410 --> 43:28.040
For me,

43:28.760 --> 43:30.290
I could stay up all night

43:30.480 --> 43:33.080
to stare at microplastic
under the microscope

43:34.030 --> 43:36.030
and find charm in something boring.

43:37.730 --> 43:40.070
Because his friend was afraid of silence,

43:42.960 --> 43:43.760
he could

43:44.670 --> 43:46.530
spend the entire night listening

43:46.590 --> 43:48.770
to the air conditioner all night long.

43:50.980 --> 43:53.640
Someone could sacrifice
his favorite sneakers

43:53.900 --> 43:56.370
to fulfill his friend's wishes.

43:58.860 --> 44:00.160
At that time, we thought

44:00.160 --> 44:02.120
these actions were impulsive

44:02.550 --> 44:03.210
and passionate.

44:02.800 --> 44:06.040
[Han Geng]

44:04.800 --> 44:06.600
When we grew up, we realized that

44:06.760 --> 44:08.620
it was the silent source of energy

44:09.340 --> 44:11.400
powering all original aspirations.

44:15.000 --> 44:17.360
The passion of youth can outlast time.

44:22.600 --> 44:27.150
[Study Plan]

44:23.400 --> 44:25.800
From today to tomorrow,

44:28.010 --> 44:28.880
to forever.
